    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Kingdom of Light and Shadow</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;As the hidden threat of Eternia's infiltration into all corner's of Etherian society comes to light. Adora must unravel the past and uncover all the secrets Light Hope had kept hidden from her. About Mara, about She-Ra and the real reason the First Ones had wired the planet. While Catra goes on a quest deep inside Mystacor, retracing Light Spinner's own journey towards the dark power that led to her downfall.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
